 "question": "Do the passes most similar to this one, by what is knowable before the waterfall is opened, carry the same recorded outcome more often than chance?",
 "design": "Four retrieval arms over the same candidate pool, under two conditions. Warm allows any other observation. Cold requires a different ground station, a different physical site and a different satellite, because in this corpus the outcome is partly a property of who recorded it. Agreement at 5 is the mean over queries of the share of retrieved neighbours carrying the query's own label.",
